              Results
              . We detect a strong signal from H
              2
              O and CO but not from CH
              4
              or CO
              2
              . This result corroborates the hypothesis of chemical disequilibrium in the atmosphere of AF Lep b. Our measurement of the RV of the planet yields Δ
              v
              
                R
                ,
                P
                ⋆
              
              = 7.8 ± 1.7 km s
              −1
